      "content": "You speak like a scholar, not a soldier. There are no counselors here, only the steel in my hand and the men coming to kill me. In the songs, they say a leader's final duty is to meet their fate with dignity so their people aren't shamed by their capture. As my old comrade, tell me... if a man's life is already ruined, is there no honor in choosing his own end?",
